.970">vibe</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:22.090" end="00:23.500"><span begin="00:22.090" end="00:22.450">Say </span><span begin="00:22.450" end="00:22.630">I'm </span><span begin="00:22.630" end="00:22.870">not </span><span begin="00:22.870" end="00:22.990">your </span><span begin="00:22.990" end="00:23.500">type</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:23.530" end="00:25.330"><span begin="00:23.530" end="00:23.830">But </span><span begin="00:23.830" end="00:23.950">I </span><span begin="00:23.950" end="00:24.160">know </span><span begin="00:24.160" end="00:24.460">what's </span><span begin="00:24.460" end="00:24.670">on </span><span begin="00:24.670" end="00:24.790">your </span><span begin="00:24.790" end="00:25.330">mind</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:25.480" end="00:29.530"><span begin="00:25.480" end="00:25.710">We </span><span begin="00:25.710" end="00:25.890">can </span><span begin="00:25.890" end="00:26.260">talk </span><span begin="00:26.260" end="00:26.620">about </span><span begin="00:26.620" end="00:27.100">nothin' </span><span begin="00:27.100" end="00:27.250">or </span><span begin="00:27.250" end="00:27.460">we </span><span begin="00:27.460" end="00:27.580">can </span><span begin="00:27.580" end="00:27.940">see </span><span begin="00:27.940" end="00:28.210">what </span><span begin="00:28.210" end="00:28.390">it's </span><span begin="00:28.390" end="00:29.530">like</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:29.740" end="00:33.100"><span begin="00:29.740" end="00:30.250">Don't </span><span begin="00:30.250" end="00:31.180">lie</span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.180">, </span><span begin="00:31.180" end="00:31.600">baby </span><span begin="00:31.600" end="00:32.020">don't </span><span begin="00:32.020" end="00:33.100">lie</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:33.130" end="00:35.980"><span begin="00:33.130" end="00:33.790">His </span><span begin="00:33.790" end="00:34.660">love </span><span begin="00:34.660" end="00:35.080">never </span><span begin="00:35.080" end="00:35.650">felt </span><span begin="00:35.650" end="00:35.980">right</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:35.980" end="00:38.740"><span begin="00:35.980" end="00:36.460">Switch </span><span begin="00:36.460" end="00:37.060">sides </span><span begin="00:37.060" end="00:37.270">and </span><span begin="00:37.270" end="00:37.450">I'm </span><span begin="00:37.450" end="00:38.530">beside </span><span begin="00:38.530" end="00:38.740">you</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:38.740" end="00:43.570"><span begin="00:38.740" end="00:38.860">If </span><span begin="00:38.860" end="00:38.950">you </span><span begin="00:38.950" end="00:39.400">say </span><span begin="00:39.400" end="00:39.670">it's </span><span begin="00:39.670" end="00:41.680">alright </span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:41.680">（</span><span begin="00:41.680" end="00:41.770">Don't </span><span begin="00:41.770" end="00:41.830">lie</span><span begin="00:41.830" end="00:41.830">, </span><span begin="00:41.830" end="00:42.190">baby </span><span begin="00:42.190" end="00:42.610">don't </span><span begin="00:42.610" end="00:43.570">lie</span><span begin="00:43.570" end="00:43.570">）</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:43.570" end="00:46.630"><span begin="00:43.570" end="00:43.750">Way </span><span begin="00:43.750" end="00:43.960">too </span><span begin="00:43.960" end="00:44.500">many </span><span begin="00:44.500" end="00:44.920">heads</span><span begin="00:44.920" end="00:44.920">, </span><span begin="00:44.920" end="00:45.160">need </span><span begin="00:45.160" end="00:45.190">a </span><span begin="00:45.190" end="00:45.760">steady </span><span begin="00:45.760" end="00:46.630">view</span></p><p ttm:agent="v1" begin="00:46.900" end="00:49.720"><span begin="00:46.900" end="00:47.440">Smokin' </span><span begin="00:47.440" end="00:48.490">cigarettes </span><span begin="00:48.490" end="00:48.640">at </span><span begin="00:48.640" end="00:48.820">the </span><span begin="00:48.820" end="